# VLSIT Open IP Core generated output and tool artifacts.
# Keep RTL, specifications, testcase sources, test generators, models, and flat verification documentation.
# `rtl/filelist.f` is the sole active RTL filelist in each numbered IP.
# `verification/` contains only docs, tests, models, env, and sim.
# Simulation/build outputs and legacy run archives are not versioned.

# --- whole-IP exclusions (deliberately not versioned) ----------------------
/016_CAN_Controller/
/017_QSPI_Controller/
/018_MKV_Block_Cipher/
/024_GPIO/
/026_I2C_Controller/
/FTEL/

# --- third-party documents kept locally for research only (not redistributed) ---
# Vendor datasheets and scientific papers; the manifest and report beside them stay versioned.
/027_ChaCha/research/vlsit_sources/

# --- simulation waveforms & sim data --------------------------------------
*.vcd
*.fst
*.fsdb
*.wlf
*.vpd
*.dat
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# --- logs & reports --------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.rpt
*.jou
*.str

# --- compiled simulation & coverage ---------------------------------------
*.vvp
*.exe
*.ucdb
*.vdb
*.cm

# --- Verilator / C++ build artifacts (all generated in this repo) ---------
# NOTE: no hand-written C++ lives here; if a DPI-C model is added, scope these
# to the build directories instead of a blanket rule.
*.cpp
*.h
*.o
*.a
*.d
*.gch
*.pch
*.rsp

# --- synthesis / STA / implementation output -------------------------------
*.sdf
*.spef
*.ddc
*.svf
*.dsn
*.edif
*.net

# --- Python cache ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- tool working / output directories -------------------------------------
build*/
obj*/
obj_dir/
coverage*/
logs*/
waveforms_sim/
mutation/
sanity_v2/
work/
sim/
tmp/

# --- synthesis directories: keep run scripts and README guides ------------
**/synthesis/**
**/synthesis/**/*.txt
**/synthesis/**/*.pdk
!**/synthesis/**/
!**/synthesis/**/README
!**/synthesis/**/README.*
!**/synthesis/**/*.ys
!**/synthesis/**/*.tcl
!**/synthesis/**/*.py
!**/synthesis/**/*.sh
!**/synthesis/**/*.ps1
!**/synthesis/**/*.bat
!**/synthesis/**/*.cmd
!**/synthesis/**/*.mk
!**/synthesis/**/Makefile

# Ignore the FTEL folder in any letter case (name given by the user)
FTEL/
ftel/
Ftel/
